nly 2 copies remaining. My hand is developing strongly in Bamboo and Dots suits with multiple potential chow formations. Discarding W5 keeps my W4 pair intact while focusing my hand toward promising sequences in T and B suits, maximizing my chances for patterns like Half Flush, All Chows, or Pure Straight variations.\n\nAnswer: Play W5"}
